  Don't fight unless you can't help it on the Astral Planes.
If you have a wand of teleport, you can avoid fighting on the
Astral Planes.

  NB: missile weapons are *much* less effective when levitating/
floating in air.

  OTOH:  None of the Riders have a ranged attack.  You don't 
have to levitate on the Astral Plane itself.  Detecting the
Riders from a distance would let you initiate Project Arrowstorm
from far away.


