  Rodney can steal your Quest Artifact.  Balrogs with bull whips
can steal your wielded weapon, or just cause you to unwield it. 

  I.e. Relying on a wielded weapon as your sole source of magic
resistance or reflection means you will really *need* those 
amulets of life saving.  

  Although you may get lucky.  There've been Ascension Runs on
NAO that I could only watch in wonder.

